+<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>CiWN 佛教語意資源 | SinDia</title><meta name="description" content="CiWN: contextual Buddhist concepts, temporal semantics, and evidence-grounded research within Sinographia Diachronica."><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head>
+<body><a class="skip" href="#main">跳至內容 / Skip to content</a>
+<header><a class="brand" href="../">SinDia <span>／ CiWN</span></a><nav aria-label="主要導覽"><a href="#lab" data-zh="書證探索" data-en="Evidence lab">書證探索</a><a href="#project" data-zh="研究架構" data-en="Research">研究架構</a><a href="#resources" data-zh="發表與資源" data-en="Materials">發表與資源</a><button id="language" type="button">English</button></nav></header>
+<main id="main"><section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">SINOGRAPHIA DIACHRONICA · BUDDHIST SEMANTICS</p><h1 data-zh="讓每一條語意關係，<br>都能回到經文。" data-en="Every semantic claim,<br>back to its evidence.">讓每一條語意關係，<br>都能回到經文。</h1><p class="lead" data-zh="CiWN（Citta WordNet）連結佛教詞義、文獻脈絡與可修訂的學術主張。從「心・意・識」出發，探索跨語與歷時的意義組織。" data-en="CiWN (Citta WordNet) connects Buddhist senses, textual contexts, and revisable scholarly claims. Our first case explores 心・意・識 and their cross-lingual and historical organization.">CiWN（Citta WordNet）連結佛教詞義、文獻脈絡與可修訂的學術主張。從「心・意・識」出發，探索跨語與歷時的意義組織。</p><div class="intro-bottom"><span data-zh="PNC 2026 · 研究原型" data-en="PNC 2026 · Research prototype">PNC 2026 · 研究原型</span><a href="#lab" data-zh="檢視一條主張 ↓" data-en="Inspect a claim ↓">檢視一條主張 ↓</a></div></section>
